  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Our aim is to enable everyone to take any off-the-shelf pair of shoes, trainers or boots, and add their own personal touch with stylish and revolutionary shoe laces and accessories!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Our TEEZY Afterglow No-Tie Shoe Laces are functional, easy to clean and offer a reliable tying method compared to knots. The universal size ensures they are suitable for the majority of shoe styles, in particular running shoes, field boots and sports trainers, due to the extremely reliable buckle and reflective laces.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">*Each set comes with a pair of reflective shoe laces and two snap-lock buckles for fastening.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Our No-Tie shoe laces are convenient, comfortable and suitable for all shoe styles.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms: Payment made monthly via automatic paypal deposits.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Other information: For more information please email: info@teezylaces.com</p>\r\n</div>",
